        "badge": "01 // MENTAL MODEL",
        "title": "Each Value Has Exactly One Owner at Any Time",
        "content": "When an owner goes out of scope, Rust automatically drops the value and frees heap memory. Assigning a heap value to another variable **moves** ownership; the original variable becomes invalid!",
        "codeSnippet": "let s1 = String::from(\"hello\");\nlet s2 = s1; // MOVED! s1 is no longer valid!\n// println!(\"{}\", s1); // Compile error!",
