        "type": "pitfall",
        "badge": "03 // DANGER ZONE",
        "title": "Filtering Left Joined Tables in WHERE Clause",
        "content": "Putting a condition on the right table in the `WHERE` clause (like `WHERE logs.status = '200'`) converts the LEFT JOIN back into an INNER JOIN!",
        "codeSnippet": "-- ❌ CONVERTS TO INNER JOIN: WHERE l.status = 'OK'\n-- ✅ PRESERVES LEFT JOIN: Put condition in ON clause: ON u.id = l.user_id AND l.status = 'OK'",
        "tip": "Hacker Rule: Filter optional tables in the ON clause, not the WHERE clause.",
        "arenaTarget": "game.html?lang=sql&diff=intermediate&stage=1"
